  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "V8jPGpwrLPmR"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 3.1 Data Extraction\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset is loaded from a CSV file into a Pandas DataFrame for processing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": None,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "OP6EAliCKetK"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv('train.csv')\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "5jZut0u_LRyL"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 3.2 Data Cleaning\n",
    "\n",
    "Rows with missing, invalid, or unrealistic values are removed to ensure data quality.\n",
    "This step improves model accuracy and reliability."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": None,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "BX6M5k4ggOuU"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Store dataset size before cleaning\n",
    "before_cleaning = df.shape\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": None,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "x8y6BSxSKgaD"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Remove rows with missing values\n",
    "df = df.dropna()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": None,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "_566d-t8KhzS"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Remove rows with invalid delivery time (zero or negative)\n",
    "df['Time_taken(min)'] = df['Time_taken(min)'].str.extract(r'(\\d+)').astype(int)\n",
    "df = df[df['Time_taken(min)'] > 0]\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": None,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "fOIDIO6WKoML"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['Delivery_person_Age'] = pd.to_numeric(df['Delivery_person_Age'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "df = df.dropna(subset=['Delivery_person_Age'])\n",
    "df = df[(df['Delivery_person_Age'] >= 18) & (df['Delivery_person_Age'] <= 60)]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": None,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "wwHqPb1QKp9i"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['Delivery_person_Ratings'] = pd.to_numeric(df['Delivery_person_Ratings'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "df = df.dropna(subset=['Delivery_person_Ratings'])\n",
    "df = df[(df['Delivery_person_Ratings'] >= 1) & (df['Delivery_person_Ratings'] <= 5)]"
   ]
  },
